# Generated skills are build output

`claude/`, `cursor/`, `codex/`, `kiro/`, `opencode/`, and `antigravity/` skill
trees (plus `kiro/power/steering/` and client `rules/*.mdc`) are **generated**.
Do not edit them, `cp` into them, or “fix drift” by hand.

**Edit only:** `skills/<slug>/SKILL.md` (and optional `rule.mdc.src.md`,
`skills/rule-targets.json`, `.loxtep/skills/<slug>.yaml`).

**Then run:**

```bash
node scripts/generate-skills.mjs
node scripts/generate-skills.mjs --check
```

Commit canonical source **and** generated output together. See `AGENTS.md`
(“CRITICAL — Do not hand-edit generated skills”) and `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
